{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41366","headline":"寄天台道友 · 卢士衡","name":"寄天台道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相思遥指玉霄峰，怅望江上阻万重。\n曾隔晓窗闻法鼓，几同寒榻听疎钟。\n别来知子长餐栢，吟处将谁对倚松。\n且住人间行圣教，莫思天路便登龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢士衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}